WEBVTT

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.729
Mr. Nelson was mad at Candy

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:07.466
and intended to make her leave

00:00:07.616 --> 00:00:13.241
while Dr. Kerry went to Chicago.

00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:21.717
Candy went to the tunnel to save workers,
but it was actually a trick by Mr. Nelson.

00:00:22.723 --> 00:00:28.127
A kind fugitive

00:00:31.966 --> 00:00:34.427
Do you want to reconsider it?

00:00:34.577 --> 00:00:38.705
No, I will not go back. I am the nurse!
I will not leave my patients.

00:00:38.915 --> 00:00:41.000
What an arrogant person.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:44.670
Let us throw you in the train.

00:00:48.582 --> 00:00:51.415
What are you doing?
Help!

00:00:51.986 --> 00:00:55.581
OK, throw her into the carriage first.

00:00:55.731 --> 00:01:02.528
Then go to the clinic to bring her luggage.
Don't forget a big sack.

00:01:04.665 --> 00:01:10.096
Send her to the station at midnight.
Make sure she takes the first train tomorrow.

00:01:10.246 --> 00:01:14.433
Wrap her and throw her in the train.

00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:16.533
Let's do it!

00:01:17.511 --> 00:01:20.674
What a stubborn girl.

00:01:34.628 --> 00:01:37.256
The project is delayed.

00:01:37.531 --> 00:01:41.363
From tomorrow,
there won't be any lazy workers.

00:01:46.574 --> 00:01:49.135
You are making too much noise!
Don't piss me off!

00:01:49.285 --> 00:01:53.943
Push her away, she is annoying.

00:01:58.052 --> 00:02:00.782
OK, that's far enough.

00:02:02.957 --> 00:02:06.893
No, I can't take the train tomorrow.

00:02:08.429 --> 00:02:09.828
Kurin...

00:02:14.468 --> 00:02:17.369
Kurin, thank you!

00:02:20.808 --> 00:02:24.744
That guy...

00:02:27.915 --> 00:02:30.009
Kurin, get on!

00:02:30.459 --> 00:02:31.710
Look, she's running away!

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:34.312
Kurin, hurry! Sit there.

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:39.922
Stop! Stop the car!
It's dangerous ahead!

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:49.425
Get on!

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:54.666
Stop the car!

00:02:54.816 --> 00:02:57.677
It's dangerous ahead!

00:03:02.883 --> 00:03:05.677
They are getting closer!

00:03:05.827 --> 00:03:07.720
Stop! Stop!

00:03:21.001 --> 00:03:22.525
Kurin, there!

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:24.897
Come on, Kurin!

00:03:28.809 --> 00:03:30.367
Oh no!

00:03:40.554 --> 00:03:42.922
McKinley, chase her!

00:03:44.391 --> 00:03:45.450
Oh no!

00:04:00.107 --> 00:04:02.098
Help!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.808
How is it?
Are you going to give up?

00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:12.394
No, I won't leave!

00:04:12.594 --> 00:04:16.656
Good, you are determined.

00:04:18.992 --> 00:04:20.584
Who are you?

00:04:20.894 --> 00:04:22.754
I don't know what she did wrong.

00:04:22.904 --> 00:04:26.825
You drunkards are bullying a girl.
So I had to step in.

00:04:26.975 --> 00:04:29.798
What did you say?

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:39.504
- Who are you? What do you want?
- I came to look for a job.

00:04:39.654 --> 00:04:45.810
You came to look for a job?
Are you kidding?

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:49.347
I am Nelson, the foreman here.
There is no job for you.

00:04:49.497 --> 00:04:54.870
You want to refuse me?
I heard you are short of workers here.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:05:01.893
We want to finish the project,
the earlier the better.

00:05:02.043 --> 00:05:06.431
Sounds like a good idea.
Let him do the carrying job at the site.

00:05:06.581 --> 00:05:08.667
Young man, as you wish.

00:05:10.777 --> 00:05:12.237
Thank you very much!

00:05:12.387 --> 00:05:14.939
It was close. Are you hurt?

00:05:15.089 --> 00:05:18.245
Thank you for saving me.

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:23.314
Your hand...
Please come to the clinic.

00:05:23.464 --> 00:05:26.381
I'm fine, it's just a small cut.

00:05:26.959 --> 00:05:33.159
No, it might get infected.
Follow me.

00:05:38.938 --> 00:05:41.132
This racoon is really gentle.

00:05:41.282 --> 00:05:44.973
Yes, we have been together
since I was a little girl.

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:47.578
It's OK now.

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:50.378
Don't pull my beard.

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:53.879
You are...

00:05:54.022 --> 00:05:58.650
- He is Dr Kerry's brother!
- I'd better wear that...

00:06:00.192 --> 00:06:02.220
It's OK, Mr. Arthur.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.988
You...

00:06:04.138 --> 00:06:06.958
Don't worry. I am your friend.

00:06:07.108 --> 00:06:09.460
I have heard about you from your sister.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:13.257
You know my sister?
Where, where is she?

00:06:13.547 --> 00:06:15.266
She's working here.

00:06:15.416 --> 00:06:16.634
Here?

00:06:16.784 --> 00:06:18.102
Where, where is she?

00:06:18.352 --> 00:06:23.341
She's not here now. A friend of mine
told us you were in Chicago.

00:06:23.491 --> 00:06:25.179
She's gone to Chicago?

00:06:25.418 --> 00:06:27.912
Yes, you just missed each other.

00:06:28.162 --> 00:06:31.449
How could it be? I came all the way
from Chicago to look for her.

00:06:31.599 --> 00:06:37.088
Dr. Kerry will come back
to the clinic soon.

00:06:37.638 --> 00:06:41.829
No, I cannot stay in the same
place for too long.

00:06:45.236 --> 00:06:46.937
You don't want to know why?

00:06:48.573 --> 00:06:50.838
I know why.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:55.172
- You know I killed someone, Candy?
- Yes.

00:06:56.082 --> 00:06:59.443
I know how much I can trust you.

00:06:59.593 --> 00:07:02.880
Dr. Kerry's bed is empty.

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:05.048
Thank you very much.

00:07:07.994 --> 00:07:09.821
What do you do now?

00:07:10.271 --> 00:07:15.593
I went to a lot of places.
Not the same place twice.

00:07:16.743 --> 00:07:19.964
You are safe here.
Rest well tonight.

00:07:20.114 --> 00:07:22.466
Thank you, Candy.

00:07:22.616 --> 00:07:24.065
Good night.

00:07:24.977 --> 00:07:29.641
Thank you, Candy
I haven't slept well for a long time.

00:07:33.085 --> 00:07:39.251
Arthur is travelling between places.
He hasn't slept well since the accident.

00:07:43.028 --> 00:07:46.727
I want to write a letter to Archie
to tell him about Arthur.

00:08:22.301 --> 00:08:23.827
Mom, all is ready!

00:08:23.977 --> 00:08:26.563
Wake up everyone up for breakfast.

00:08:27.113 --> 00:08:28.801
Yes!

00:08:30.642 --> 00:08:37.172
Get up! Breakfast is ready!

00:08:40.118 --> 00:08:45.749
Belle, is it bean rice again today?
Can't we have something different?

00:08:45.899 --> 00:08:50.353
What are you complaining about?
You are the fattest among us.

00:08:50.503 --> 00:08:51.621
That's right.

00:08:51.771 --> 00:08:54.722
Get up, breakfast is ready!

00:09:18.723 --> 00:09:22.625
Kurin, it's you!
Good morning, Kurin!

00:09:27.999 --> 00:09:34.403
You are washing your face by yourself.
You've really grown up, Kurin.

00:09:35.573 --> 00:09:37.333
Good morning, Mr. Arthur.

00:09:37.483 --> 00:09:38.935
Are you awake?

00:09:39.085 --> 00:09:41.570
Yes, Candy, please come in.

00:09:41.813 --> 00:09:43.838
Good morning, Mr. Arthur.

00:09:44.082 --> 00:09:45.806
Morning, Candy.

00:09:45.956 --> 00:09:48.011
Did you sleep well?

00:09:48.161 --> 00:09:53.850
Yes, thanks. It's the first time
I've slept so well since I ran away.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:58.488
That's great! Breakfast is ready.
Aren't you working today?

00:09:59.138 --> 00:10:01.588
- You've got to eat well.
- Thank you.

00:10:02.667 --> 00:10:10.164
We don't have anything special here.
I hope it tastes good.

00:10:11.075 --> 00:10:14.904
It's good, Candy! You cook well.

00:10:15.054 --> 00:10:18.847
Great! I was a little worried.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:23.049
I haven't had hot food
for a long time.

00:10:27.124 --> 00:10:32.388
Right, Candy,
why aren't you having breakfast?

00:10:32.538 --> 00:10:36.525
Margo will make breakfast for me later.

00:10:36.675 --> 00:10:39.228
Did you only cook for me?

00:10:39.378 --> 00:10:43.299
That's right,
but don't feel uncomfortable.

00:10:43.449 --> 00:10:44.864
Thank you.

00:10:45.076 --> 00:10:51.307
Mr. Nelson will probably give you
a hard time. He will be mean to you.

00:10:51.457 --> 00:10:54.882
That's all right. I can take it.
I am used to it.

00:10:57.088 --> 00:11:02.549
Hey, new guy!
Come out to work, don't try to be lazy!

00:11:04.462 --> 00:11:06.453
Yes, he is coming!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.661
Be careful.

00:11:11.811 --> 00:11:13.729
Don't worry.
Thank you, Candy.

00:11:13.879 --> 00:11:16.170
Hurry up, everyone's waiting.

00:11:17.141 --> 00:11:18.534
Be careful!

00:11:18.684 --> 00:11:20.770
Thank you!

00:11:36.127 --> 00:11:39.055
Archie, thank you for your hosting.

00:11:39.205 --> 00:11:43.959
You don't have to. If there's any news,
I'll notify Candy as soon as possible.

00:11:44.109 --> 00:11:45.797
Please, do.

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:48.638
To the train station, please.

00:11:49.106 --> 00:11:51.367
Say hello to Candy for me.

00:11:51.817 --> 00:11:53.102
OK, bye, Archie!

00:11:53.252 --> 00:11:54.474
Goodbye

00:12:01.118 --> 00:12:04.586
Archie, are you here? Archie!

00:12:08.893 --> 00:12:11.623
Where did Archie go?

00:12:21.405 --> 00:12:25.432
Express mail? It's from Candy...

00:12:35.052 --> 00:12:38.510
"Arthur is with me..."
Who is Arthur?

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:53.798
Right! Archie's draft letter to Candy.

00:12:54.805 --> 00:13:00.671
Arthur is a wanted murderer.
Candy is hiding a criminal?

00:13:05.482 --> 00:13:07.541
To the police station, quick!

00:13:15.292 --> 00:13:18.318
Eliza, where are you rushing to?

00:13:18.929 --> 00:13:24.663
If it's true that she is hiding a criminal,
Candy will lose her nurse qualification.

00:13:25.035 --> 00:13:27.162
This time, Candy...

00:13:32.509 --> 00:13:38.674
It's already eight o'clock.
They should be off work by now.

00:13:38.824 --> 00:13:41.445
I am worried.
Did anything happen to Mr. Arthur?

00:13:44.922 --> 00:13:48.817
What's wrong?
Hang in there, McKinley!

00:13:48.967 --> 00:13:52.855
Hang in there, McKinley!
Who did this?

00:13:53.205 --> 00:13:55.290
It wouldn't have been the workers.

00:13:55.840 --> 00:14:01.563
Everyone knows that boss treat him like
his child, no one would touch him...

00:14:01.713 --> 00:14:04.163
Hang in there, McKinley!

00:14:05.892 --> 00:14:07.826
McKinley!

00:14:08.127 --> 00:14:10.823
What's wrong?

00:14:11.531 --> 00:14:13.091
You came at the right time, Candy.

00:14:13.241 --> 00:14:17.595
Candy, please save McKinley!

00:14:19.745 --> 00:14:22.133
Mr. Nelson, McKinley is ill.

00:14:22.283 --> 00:14:26.104
Ill? Not hurt by somebody?

00:14:26.254 --> 00:14:27.605
What's the illness?

00:14:27.755 --> 00:14:28.506
It's...

00:14:28.656 --> 00:14:31.509
You don't even know the problem,
what kind of nurse are you?

00:14:31.659 --> 00:14:34.679
I am a nurse for people.

00:14:34.829 --> 00:14:37.018
McKinley is the same as a person!

00:14:39.458 --> 00:14:43.087
My brother was studying to be a vet
while working part time.

00:14:43.237 --> 00:14:47.391
Mr. Nelson, there is only one person
who can save McKinley!

00:14:47.541 --> 00:14:49.660
Who?

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:51.028
Mr. Arthur.

00:14:51.178 --> 00:14:52.663
The young man?

00:14:52.813 --> 00:14:55.600
Yes. Arthur has studied
veterinary medicine.

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:59.537
Oh no...
Arthur is still working overtime.

00:14:59.687 --> 00:15:01.139
What did you say?

00:15:01.289 --> 00:15:05.710
Come on, bring him here right away.
Let him treat McKinley!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.412
Mr. Nelson!

00:15:12.225 --> 00:15:19.288
McKinley, open your mouth. Yes, good boy.
Don't worry, I'll take care of him tonight.

00:15:19.438 --> 00:15:23.860
- Candy, get some blankets for me please.
- OK.

00:15:28.007 --> 00:15:34.378
How would someone like him kill anyone?
Why did he become a killer?

00:15:45.958 --> 00:15:48.426
Your ticket please.

00:15:49.628 --> 00:15:50.955
The last station.

00:15:51.105 --> 00:15:51.956
Yes.

00:15:52.106 --> 00:15:55.296
Are you going to the construction site
in Graytown?

00:15:56.669 --> 00:16:03.507
People getting off at the last station go
there. Won't be there until tomorrow night.

00:16:09.348 --> 00:16:13.512
Good boy, McKinley. He's eating.

00:16:15.921 --> 00:16:22.353
Let me feed him and take some rest.
You are tired and still working!

00:16:22.503 --> 00:16:28.759
Not really. You too. I don't have
to hide anymore thanks to you.

00:16:28.909 --> 00:16:31.860
It's my duty to take care of McKinley.

00:16:32.438 --> 00:16:35.733
I feel like being myself again,
I am so happy.

00:16:35.883 --> 00:16:37.298
Mr. Arthur...

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.871
Breakfast is here!

00:16:41.021 --> 00:16:43.307
Please, Candy.

00:16:43.457 --> 00:16:44.815
Thank you.

00:16:45.918 --> 00:16:48.178
That's a lot of food!

00:16:48.328 --> 00:16:50.180
Mr. Nelson asked us to do this.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:51.647
Mr. Nelson?

00:16:53.258 --> 00:16:57.851
Not me, it's McKinley.

00:16:58.001 --> 00:17:02.093
- Please eat, Mr. Arthur.
- Yes.

00:17:15.981 --> 00:17:21.412
Passengers to the terminal station,
please come to the first carriage.

00:17:21.562 --> 00:17:24.650
The train will stop for about an hour.

00:17:27.226 --> 00:17:30.187
Graytown? It's not an easy journey.

00:17:30.337 --> 00:17:32.156
I received a telegram from Chicago.

00:17:32.306 --> 00:17:34.692
To chase the runaway criminal?

00:17:34.842 --> 00:17:36.193
Something like that.

00:17:36.343 --> 00:17:38.099
It must be tiresome...

00:17:39.605 --> 00:17:42.540
Could it be possible that
my brother is in Graytown?

00:18:28.386 --> 00:18:35.014
There is only the two of us.
This is an admirable job.

00:18:35.164 --> 00:18:37.218
There is another person over there.

00:18:40.631 --> 00:18:44.394
Excuse me, are you going to the
construction site in Graytown?

00:18:44.544 --> 00:18:45.928
Yes.

00:18:46.078 --> 00:18:47.937
Have you been there before?

00:18:48.773 --> 00:18:50.206
For a short time.

00:18:50.475 --> 00:18:54.482
Do you know a nurse in the clinic,
called Candice?

00:18:54.632 --> 00:18:55.805
A nurse?

00:18:55.955 --> 00:19:00.410
Somebody revealed to the police
that a nurse is hiding a criminal.

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.578
- Hey!
- Excuse me.

00:19:05.556 --> 00:19:08.588
It is Arthur.
Arthur came to look for me.

00:19:18.502 --> 00:19:25.234
Because of the rain, they will close
the railway and your sister will be late.

00:19:30.114 --> 00:19:34.376
- What a heavy rain !
- The railway is closed.

00:19:34.526 --> 00:19:35.878
Are there any hotels around here?

00:19:36.028 --> 00:19:42.052
There are no hotels here.
We have to stay here tonight.

00:19:42.902 --> 00:19:44.522
Really?

00:19:45.529 --> 00:19:49.125
Have a drink to warm you up.

00:19:49.275 --> 00:19:52.094
Where's the other passenger?

00:19:52.244 --> 00:19:56.800
He said he was going to the restroom
but he didn't come back yet.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:02.438
- Strange guy. He was hiding his face.
- Let me check outside.

00:20:02.588 --> 00:20:04.106
I'll come with you.

00:20:04.556 --> 00:20:06.607
Please be careful.

00:20:10.788 --> 00:20:13.916
I must help Arthur turn himself in.

00:20:16.427 --> 00:20:18.153
Did you find him?

00:20:18.403 --> 00:20:22.328
- I couldn't find him anywhere.
- Where did he go?

00:20:22.666 --> 00:20:26.195
Does this have anything to do
with the criminal?

00:20:26.345 --> 00:20:27.396
Don't worry.

00:20:27.546 --> 00:20:30.702
The tunnel is closed,
he won't be able to go anywhere.

00:21:09.079 --> 00:21:11.173
When will the rain stop?

00:21:11.323 --> 00:21:14.108
It won't stop.

00:21:15.219 --> 00:21:21.749
After the rain stops, Candy and Arthur
have no idea about what will happen.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:27.795
The clinic in the mountains at night,
now looks even more desolate.
